@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api/webhooks
@steadfastWebhookSecret = {{$dotenv %STEADFAST_WEBHOOK_SECRET%}}
@pathaoWebhookSecret = {{$dotenv %PATHAO_WEBHOOK_SECRET%}}
@orderNumber = ORD-492810-42

### Set STEADFAST_WEBHOOK_SECRET and PATHAO_WEBHOOK_SECRET in your local environment.
### Replace the example order and consignment IDs with orders actually assigned to each courier.
### Both courier integrations and webhook secrets must be configured in Admin > Logistics.

### Simulate Steadfast parcel delivered
POST {{baseUrl}}/steadfast
Authorization: Bearer {{steadfastWebhookSecret}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "notification_type": "delivery_status",
  "consignment_id": "12345678",
  "invoice": "{{orderNumber}}",
  "cod_amount": 1010,
  "status": "delivered",
  "tracking_message": "Parcel delivered to customer"
}

### Simulate Pathao parcel returned
### The webhook must match a Pathao-linked order; the handler checks the live Pathao status.
POST {{baseUrl}}/pathao
X-Pathao-Signature: {{pathaoWebhookSecret}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "event": "order.returned-to-merchant",
  "consignment_id": "PT-987654321",
  "merchant_order_id": "{{orderNumber}}",
  "order_status": "Returned",
  "order_status_slug": "returned"
}
